{#
  The health sheet (specifications.md §44). Sixty fields, so the form is cut
  into collapsible sections rather than into pages: ONE form, one submit, so
  a family that fills in half of it and saves loses nothing — which several
  pages would not give them.

  Every field is optional and nothing here can be refused, so there is no
  error state to draw. The only messages this screen shows are the flash
  from a save or a clear.

  Nothing on this page says « Desk », « année de membre » or any other word
  from the inside of the site: it is read by parents.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Fiche santé — {{ site_name }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{% set yes_no_options = [
    { value: '', label: 'Non précisé' },
    { value: 'yes', label: 'Oui' },
    { value: 'no', label: 'Non' },
] %}
<div class="page-narrow">
    {% include 'partials/page_header.html.twig' with {
        title: 'Fiche santé',
        subtitle: member|display_name,
    } only %}

    <p>
        Ces informations permettent de remplir la fiche santé officielle de la fédération.
        Tout est facultatif : remplissez ce que vous voulez, quand vous voulez.
        {% if last_used_at %}
            <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary">
                Dernière mise à jour le {{ last_used_at|date('d/m/Y') }}.
            </span>
        {% endif %}
    </p>

    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
        Le document imprimé n'a aucune valeur tant qu'il n'est pas signé à la main.
        Seule la version signée et remise à l'animateur compte.
    </div>

    {% if document_error %}
        <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">{{ document_error }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    {#
      What will NOT fit on the federation's form, said here and not
      discovered on paper. The document stays downloadable — what fits is
      written, nothing is cut in silence — so this warns rather than blocks:
      a family whose allergy list runs long still needs their form, and they
      are the ones who know what can be shortened.
    #}
    {% if overflowing is not empty %}
        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
            <p class="mb-1">
                Le formulaire officiel ne réserve que quelques lignes imprimées à certaines réponses.
                Ce que vous avez écrit ici ne tiendra pas entièrement sur le document :
            </p>
            <ul class="mb-1">
                {#
                  Already French sentences when they get here: the
                  controller resolves each name through
                  `HealthSheet::LABELS`, precisely so this loop can never
                  print an internal field name to a parent.
                #}
                {% for label in overflowing %}
                    <li>{{ label }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-0">
                Raccourcissez ces réponses, ou joignez une feuille séparée à la fiche imprimée.
            </p>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}

        <div class="accordion mb-3" id="health-sheet-sections">

            {# --- Identité : read-only, and not stored by this module --- #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-identity" aria-expanded="true"
                            aria-controls="section-identity">
                        Identité
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-identity" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <p class="small text-body-secondary">
                            Non modifiable ici. Ces informations viennent de votre inscription à la
                            fédération. Pour les corriger, prévenez votre animateur.
                        </p>
                        <dl class="row mb-0">
                            <dt class="col-sm-4">Prénom et nom</dt>
                            <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ member|display_name }}</dd>
                            {% if member.birthDate %}
                                <dt class="col-sm-4">Date de naissance</dt>
                                <dd class="col-sm-8">{{ member.birthDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</dd>
                            {% endif %}
                        </dl>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# --- Two emergency contacts --- #}
            {% for n in [1, 2] %}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-contact{{ n }}" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-contact{{ n }}">
                        Personne à contacter en cas d'urgence {{ n }}
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-contact{{ n }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-name', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_name',
                            label: 'Nom et prénom', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_name'],
                            autocomplete: 'off',
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-relationship',
                            field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_relationship',
                            label: 'Lien de parenté', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_relationship'],
                        } only %}
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-phone', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_phone',
                                    type: 'tel', label: 'Téléphone', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_phone'],
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-email', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_email',
                                    type: 'email', label: 'Adresse e-mail', value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_email'],
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'contact' ~ n ~ '-note', field_name: 'contact' ~ n ~ '_note',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Remarque',
                            value: sheet['contact' ~ n ~ '_note'],
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}

            {# --- Family doctor --- #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-doctor" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-doctor">
                        Médecin traitant
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-doctor" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'doctor-first-name', field_name: 'doctor_first_name',
                                    label: 'Prénom', value: sheet.doctor_first_name,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'doctor-last-name', field_name: 'doctor_last_name',
                                    label: 'Nom', value: sheet.doctor_last_name,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'doctor-phone', field_name: 'doctor_phone',
                            type: 'tel', label: 'Téléphone', value: sheet.doctor_phone,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# --- Health --- #}
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#section-health" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="section-health">
                        Santé
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="section-health" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#health-sheet-sections">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'height', field_name: 'height',
                                    label: 'Taille', value: sheet.height,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'weight', field_name: 'weight',
                                    label: 'Poids', value: sheet.weight,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        {#
                          Three questions below are a PAIR OF SQUARES on the
                          printed form and nothing else, so the screen offers
                          the same three answers the paper does — including
                          « Non précisé », which leaves both squares blank.
                          A free-text box here let a parent answer « oui sauf
                          la natation » and the document crossed neither.
                        #}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'participation', field_name: 'participation',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'Peut participer à toutes les activités proposées',
                            value: sheet.participation,
                            options: yes_no_options,
                            help: 'Sport, excursions, jeux, baignade… Précisez ci-dessous si besoin.',
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'participation-details', field_name: 'participation_details',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Précisions',
                            value: sheet.participation_details,
                        } only %}

                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'swimming-level', field_name: 'swimming_level',
                            type: 'select', label: 'Niveau de natation',
                            value: sheet.swimming_level,
                            options: [
                                { value: '', label: 'Non précisé' },
                                { value: 'very_good', label: 'Très bien' },
                                { value: 'good', label: 'Bien' },
                                { value: 'fair', label: 'Moyennement bien' },
                                { value: 'poor', label: 'Difficilement' },
                                { value: 'not_at_all', label: 'Pas du tout' },
                            ],
                        } only %}

                        <fieldset class="mb-3">
                            <legend class="form-label">Votre enfant souffre-t-il de&nbsp;:</legend>
                            <div class="row g-2">
                                {% for condition in conditions %}
                                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="conditions[]"
                                               id="condition-{{ condition }}" value="{{ condition }}"
                                               {{ sheet.conditions[condition] ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                        <label class="form-check-label tap-target" for="condition-{{ condition }}">
                                            {#
                                              The federation's own wording, in
                                              its own order. A label invented
                                              here would offer a parent a box
                                              the printed form does not have.
                                            #}
                                            {{ {
                                                'diabetes': 'Diabète',
                                                'car_sickness': 'Mal des transports',
                                                'heart_condition': 'Affection cardiaque',
                                                'mental_disability': 'Handicap mental',
                                                'asthma': 'Asthme',
                                                'rheumatism': 'Rhumatisme',
                                                'skin_condition': 'Affection cutanée',
                                                'motor_disability': 'Handicap moteur',
                                                'epilepsy': 'Épilepsie',
                                                'bedwetting': 'Énurésie nocturne',
                                                'sleepwalking': 'Somnambulisme',
                                                'headaches': 'Maux de tête / migraines',
                                            }[condition] }}
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>

                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'conditions-details', field_name: 'conditions_details',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                            label: 'Fréquence, gravité, mesures à prendre',
                            value: sheet.conditions_details,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'illnesses', field_name: 'illnesses_and_operations',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3, label: 'Maladies et opérations',
                            value: sheet.illnesses_and_operations,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'useful-information', field_name: 'useful_information',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3,
                            label: 'Autres informations utiles',
                            value: sheet.useful_information,
                            help: 'Port de lunettes ou de lentilles, appareil dentaire, sommeil, alimentation…',
                        } only %}

                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'tetanus', field_name: 'tetanus_vaccinated',
                                    type: 'select',
                                    label: 'En ordre de vaccination contre le tétanos',
                                    value: sheet.tetanus_vaccinated,
                                    options: yes_no_options,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'tetanus-booster', field_name: 'tetanus_last_booster',
                                    label: 'Date du dernier rappel',
                                    value: sheet.tetanus_last_booster,
                                } only %}
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'allergies', field_name: 'allergies',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Allergies',
                            value: sheet.allergies,
                            help: 'Médicaments, aliments, piqûres, autres.',
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'allergy-consequences', field_name: 'allergy_consequences',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2,
                            label: 'Conséquences et mesures à prendre',
                            value: sheet.allergy_consequences,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'diet', field_name: 'diet',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 2, label: 'Régime alimentaire',
                            value: sheet.diet,
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'treatment', field_name: 'treatment',
                            type: 'textarea', rows: 3, label: 'Traitement en cours',
                            value: sheet.treatment,
                            help: 'Joignez l\'ordonnance à la fiche imprimée.',
                        } only %}
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'treatment-autonomy', field_name: 'treatment_autonomy',
                            type: 'select',
                            label: 'Votre enfant prend-il ce traitement seul ?',
                            value: sheet.treatment_autonomy,
                            options: yes_no_options,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Enregistrer
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>

    {#
      A form of its own, and a POST rather than a link: everything on this
      document is a child's health, and a GET is what a proxy log, a browser
      history and a `Referer` header keep.

      Outside the form above on purpose — this downloads what was LAST
      SAVED, so mixing the two buttons would suggest that unsaved edits come
      out on the paper. The sentence under the button says so.
    #}
    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante/pdf" class="mt-3">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Télécharger la fiche à imprimer
        </button>
        <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary mt-1">
            Le formulaire officiel de la fédération, pré-rempli avec ce qui est enregistré ici.
            Enregistrez d'abord si vous venez de modifier quelque chose.
        </span>
    </form>

    {#
      A separate form: « Tout effacer » destroys data, so it must not be a
      second button inside the form that saves — a stray Enter key would
      otherwise be one keystroke away from it.

      A plain dialog, not the retyped keyword of the Maintenance page: that
      one protects a whole installation, this is a family acting on its own
      data.

      `data-confirm` rather than an inline `onsubmit`: inline handlers are
      dead under this site's CSP, so a `confirm()` written there would not
      ask anything at all — the form would just submit, and the one place
      that must never happen silently is the button that destroys a child's
      health data. `Tests\Core\View\UxConventionsTest` is what says so.
    #}
    <form method="post" action="/members/{{ member.memberYearId }}/fiche-sante/effacer" class="mt-4"
          data-confirm="Effacer définitivement toute la fiche santé de {{ member|display_name }} ? Cette opération ne se défait pas."
          data-confirm-label="Tout effacer">
        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">
            <i class="bi bi-trash me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Tout effacer
        </button>
        <span class="d-block small text-body-secondary mt-1">
            Supprime définitivement du site tout ce que vous avez saisi ici.
        </span>
    </form>
</div>
{% endblock %}
